Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You open your feed for something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, you keep returning\Nto the same topics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The videos change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The interests we explore\Ncan stay surprisingly familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We began to worry that our interests\Nwere narrowing without us noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Research gave us a reason\Nto take that question seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A Spotify study linked algorithmic listening\Nwith lower consumption diversity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Other researchers showed, in simulations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,how recommendation feedback loops\Ncan make users' choices more similar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and reduce the value they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That raised a question for us:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we make unfamiliar interests\Neasier to discover?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is OtherWise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Other, for another perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise, for more thoughtful judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And an invitation to think otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Start with an interest you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,OtherWise suggests unfamiliar\Nbut related topics across fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You control how far to explore,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,from nearby ideas to broader connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow a topic that catches your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it when you want to pursue it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and explore from that new starting point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A galaxy map makes your exploration visible,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can revisit discoveries\Nand choose where to go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Existing research gives this direction\Nan initial basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.22,0:01:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In a small user study,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Auralist produced more useful,\Npreviously unknown recommendations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Its authors also proposed letting users\Nadjust the level of novelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,PURS showed how unexpected recommendations\Ncould remain relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.06,0:01:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Our proposed contribution is to bring these ideas\Ninto a general topic explorer:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,interests you confirm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,gradual exploration across fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and a visual record of your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're developing it as both a product\Nand a research project.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.98,0:01:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, we want to test
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,whether a new discovery today\Ncan grow into a lasting interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If your research connects with recommendation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,learning, or human-computer interaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd love your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,OtherWise. Your world, a little wider.
